            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 2,
            "SpeakerName": "教会工作人员",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "啊，八惠亲！你好。/n谢谢你今天愿意来帮忙游泳教室。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424110020",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142411003,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 3,
            "SpeakerName": "教会工作人员",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不过……在你的休息日拜托你，真的没问题吗？/n舞台排练也很忙吧？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424110030",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
