            "EpisodeMasterId": 142411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 5,
            "SpeakerName": "八惠",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我今天也没有特别的安排，/n而且最重要的是，只要能帮上大家，我也很开心♪",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424110050",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "104"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142411006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "教会工作人员",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "真的？你愿意这么说就帮大忙了。/n一直以来都谢谢你。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424110060",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142411007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "教会工作人员",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "要是有什么为难的事，什么都可以告诉我。/n那接下来就拜托你啦。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424110070",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142411008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142411,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "八惠",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "好的！请交给我吧！",
